==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Croakley]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Puffzerker]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Before starting the stage, know that money a a big issue in the stage, so using a [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]] is highly reccomended. The only enemy that gives you money is the Pigge at the start, which you can kill with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] for a decent cash boost. Once Rain D. spawns, lure him away from Sunfish Jones and burst him down with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and start meatshielding with [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]], and eventually [[Talents|Talented]] [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]] when Doctor K.O. spawns. Rain D. should die before K.O. kills Bahamut, you should have enough money to send out [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Mewtone]]. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and Can Can Cat should be able to kill K.O. relatively easily, and the defence boost and debuff resistance Mewtone gets from Sage Slayer makes him great against Tarsiriel. Assuming you didn't push too far into Jones' range, Mewtone should have a decent amount of hp left when Rain D. #2 spawns. His massive range makes getting slowed by Croakley not a big deal as he can still attack K.O. and Rain D. in that state. For said second Rain D., simply repeat the same process as the first. Once all the Doctor K.O.s and both Rain D.s are dead, the remaining Croakley, Sunfish Jones and Puffzerker aren't an issue.

