==Trivia==
*Based on its Japanese name and how it's in the same sub-chapter as [[Sage of Selection Darvin]], The Dogma Divide refers to the divide between [[wikipedia:Rejection of evolution by religious groups|evolution and religious dogma]]. It may also reference the [[wikipedia:Central dogma of molecular biology|central dogma of molecular biology]].

